    </mxCell>
    <mxCell id="questions" value="&lt;b&gt;Open questions and assumptions&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot; color=&quot;#475569&quot;&gt;&amp;#8226; O-38: walk-out policy, who bears the loss, and the hold terms&lt;br&gt;&amp;#8226; O-32: when the POS total differs from the bill, what is the rule?&lt;br&gt;&amp;#8226; O-45, O-48: POS-added lines, disputes and the served signal need business answers&lt;/font&gt;" style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Helvetica;rounded=0;fontSize=11;fontColor=#0F172A;strokeColor=#CBD5E1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeWidth=1.5;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=2;spacingBottom=2;dashed=1;dashPattern=4 3;fillColor=#FFFBEB;strokeColor=#D97706;" vertex="1" parent="1">
     <mxGeometry x="928" y="640" width="748" height="104" as="geometry"/>
    </mxCell>
    <mxCell id="f1" value="&lt;b&gt;1 The customer leaves without paying&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:12px&quot; color=&quot;#B91C1C&quot;&gt;Staff flag the tab: MarkTabUnpaid with a reason (grant tab.override).&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:12px&quot; color=&quot;#B91C1C&quot;&gt;It becomes abandoned_unpaid. A card hold may be captured only&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:12px&quot; color=&quot;#B91C1C&quot;&gt;under the terms shown at the hold. No timer closes it.&lt;/font&gt;" style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Helvetica;rounded=1;arcSize=10;fontSize=13;fontColor=#0F172A;strokeColor=#DC2626;fillColor=#FEF2F2;strokeWidth=1.5;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=2;spacingBottom=2;" vertex="1" parent="1">
     <mxGeometry x="24" y="110" width="520" height="130" as="geometry"/>
    </mxCell>
    <mxCell id="f2" value="&lt;b&gt;2 The POS is offline when a round is sent&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:12px&quot; color=&quot;#B91C1C&quot;&gt;The POS worker retries from the outbox. The round stays fired.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:12px&quot; color=&quot;#B91C1C&quot;&gt;After the POS window the sweeper rejects the round and the&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:12px&quot; color=&quot;#B91C1C&quot;&gt;diner is told to ask staff. Nothing is billed. The tab stays open.&lt;/font&gt;" style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Helvetica;rounded=1;arcSize=10;fontSize=13;fontColor=#0F172A;strokeColor=#DC2626;fillColor=#FEF2F2;strokeWidth=1.5;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=2;spacingBottom=2;" vertex="1" parent="1">
     <mxGeometry x="584" y="110" width="520" height="130" as="geometry"/>
    </mxCell>
    <mxCell id="f3" value="&lt;b&gt;3 Payment fails at the end&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:12px&quot; color=&quot;#B91C1C&quot;&gt;payment.events {failed} puts the tab back to bill_requested&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:12px&quot; color=&quot;#B91C1C&quot;&gt;and unlocks it. The diner retries or picks another method.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:12px&quot; color=&quot;#B91C1C&quot;&gt;The voucher hold stays for the retry.&lt;/font&gt;" style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Helvetica;rounded=1;arcSize=10;fontSize=13;fontColor=#0F172A;strokeColor=#DC2626;fillColor=#FEF2F2;strokeWidth=1.5;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=2;spacingBottom=2;" vertex="1" parent="1">
     <mxGeometry x="1144" y="110" width="520" height="130" as="geometry"/>
    </mxCell>
    <mxCell id="f4" value="&lt;b&gt;4 Paid, but the POS check will not close&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:12px&quot; color=&quot;#B91C1C&quot;&gt;The tab stays paid. CloseCheck is retried, then a staff queue&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:12px&quot; color=&quot;#B91C1C&quot;&gt;entry carries the payment reference. No second charge and no&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:12px&quot; color=&quot;#B91C1C&quot;&gt;automatic refund. Staff close the check in the POS.&lt;/font&gt;" style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Helvetica;rounded=1;arcSize=10;fontSize=13;fontColor=#0F172A;strokeColor=#DC2626;fillColor=#FEF2F2;strokeWidth=1.5;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=2;spacingBottom=2;" vertex="1" parent="1">
     <mxGeometry x="24" y="260" width="520" height="130" as="geometry"/>
    </mxCell>
    <mxCell id="f5" value="&lt;b&gt;5 The kitchen rejects or voids after the fire&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:12px&quot; color=&quot;#B91C1C&quot;&gt;rejected is applied from the POS and left out of the bill.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:12px&quot; color=&quot;#B91C1C&quot;&gt;A void after ready is not applied from the POS: only staff can&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:12px&quot; color=&quot;#B91C1C&quot;&gt;VoidRound, with a reason. The agreed lines are never rewritten.&lt;/font&gt;" style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Helvetica;rounded=1;arcSize=10;fontSize=13;fontColor=#0F172A;strokeColor=#DC2626;fillColor=#FEF2F2;strokeWidth=1.5;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=2;spacingBottom=2;" vertex="1" parent="1">
     <mxGeometry x="584" y="260" width="520" height="130" as="geometry"/>
    </mxCell>
    <mxCell id="f6" value="&lt;b&gt;6 App payment and counter settlement collide&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:12px&quot; color=&quot;#B91C1C&quot;&gt;The first one to commit wins. If the POS settled first, the later&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:12px&quot; color=&quot;#B91C1C&quot;&gt;captured meets a closed tab: a CSC refund task is raised.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:12px&quot; color=&quot;#B91C1C&quot;&gt;If the app was first, the POS update goes to reconciliation.&lt;/font&gt;" style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Helvetica;rounded=1;arcSize=10;fontSize=13;fontColor=#0F172A;strokeColor=#DC2626;fillColor=#FEF2F2;strokeWidth=1.5;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=2;spacingBottom=2;" vertex="1" parent="1">
     <mxGeometry x="1144" y="260" width="520" height="130" as="geometry"/>
    </mxCell>
    <mxCell id="f7" value="&lt;b&gt;7 Someone orders from a photo of the QR&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:12px&quot; color=&quot;#B91C1C&quot;&gt;Guard levels: rate limit and caps always (G1), a table code (G2,&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:12px&quot; color=&quot;#B91C1C&quot;&gt;proposed default), staff confirm of the first round (G3).&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:12px&quot; color=&quot;#B91C1C&quot;&gt;A round to an empty table shows on the table board.&lt;/font&gt;" style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Helvetica;rounded=1;arcSize=10;fontSize=13;fontColor=#0F172A;strokeColor=#DC2626;fillColor=#FEF2F2;strokeWidth=1.5;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=2;spacingBottom=2;" vertex="1" parent="1">
     <mxGeometry x="24" y="410" width="520" height="130" as="geometry"/>
    </mxCell>
    <mxCell id="f8" value="&lt;b&gt;8 The store closes with tabs still open&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:12px&quot; color=&quot;#B91C1C&quot;&gt;The sweeper puts every open tab on the staff queue. It never&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:12px&quot; color=&quot;#B91C1C&quot;&gt;marks them paid or unpaid. New sessions are refused by the&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:12px&quot; color=&quot;#B91C1C&quot;&gt;store hours. A tab past the maximum time is queued too.&lt;/font&gt;" style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Helvetica;rounded=1;arcSize=10;fontSize=13;fontColor=#0F172A;strokeColor=#DC2626;fillColor=#FEF2F2;strokeWidth=1.5;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=2;spacingBottom=2;" vertex="1" parent="1">
     <mxGeometry x="584" y="410" width="520" height="130" as="geometry"/>
    </mxCell>
    <mxCell id="f9" value="&lt;b&gt;9 The bill is disputed, or the POS total differs&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:12px&quot; color=&quot;#B91C1C&quot;&gt;Staff VoidRound before payment, which raises bill_version so a&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:12px&quot; color=&quot;#B91C1C&quot;&gt;stale PayBill is rejected. The diner pays what the app showed.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:12px&quot; color=&quot;#B91C1C&quot;&gt;A POS total gap is a reconciliation row, not a price change.&lt;/font&gt;" style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Helvetica;rounded=1;arcSize=10;fontSize=13;fontColor=#0F172A;strokeColor=#DC2626;fillColor=#FEF2F2;strokeWidth=1.5;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=2;spacingBottom=2;" vertex="1" parent="1">
     <mxGeometry x="1144" y="410" width="520" height="130" as="geometry"/>
    </mxCell>
    <mxCell id="n1" value="All 20 edge cases are in docs/design/postpaid-table-ordering.md section 12, including a changed price, a moved table, a partial payment and a voucher that is not valid." style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Helvetica;text;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12;fontColor=#475569;spacingLeft=2;spacingRight=2;spacingTop=0;spacingBottom=0;" vertex="1" parent="1">
     <mxGeometry x="24" y="570" width="1650" height="22" as="geometry"/>
    </mxCell>
   </root>
  </mxGraphModel>
 </diagram>
